      "created_at": "2013-10-29T12:37:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But I've never been able to figure out, why exactly does he get to Overdrive at the same time?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I always imagined that going to the salvage yard was rejuvenating for him, getting him back to his place of focus, and giving him the energy to go into overdrive.</p>\n<p>Or he's actually a cyborg…  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And on the subject of flavor weirdness, what exactly do you think is going on when Fixer uses Grease Monkey Fist to change his damage types to various weird things? Like, say he hits Absolute Zero for Cold damage…what exactly do you figure is going on there, gameworld-wise?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm with pwatson1974: I imagined he's channeling his chi to emulate/create other energies.</p>",
